    <string name="dev_link_away_short">Hairi kupindura</string>
    <string name="dev_link_debugging_off">TV yaramba kubatana. Tarisa kuti USB debugging yakabatidzwa. Kubva pa Android TV 14 mamwe maTV anogamuchira Wireless debugging chete, iyo TennaRC isati yakwanisa kushandisa.</string>
    <string name="dev_link_debugging_off_short">Debugging yakadzimwa paTV</string>
    <string name="dev_link_wireless">Wireless debugging chete ndiyo yakabatidzwa, iyo TennaRC isati yakwanisa kushandisa. Batidzawo USB debugging, kana kuti sunganidza kamwe chete uchibva pakombiyuta womhanyisa adb tcpip 5555, izvo zvinogara kusvikira TV yatangazve.</string>
    <string name="dev_link_wireless_short">Wireless debugging chete ndiyo yakabatidzwa</string>
